fiya kawai a matsayin kimar farawa mai iya canzawa, kuma yana dakatar da haraji na hadin gwiwa, inshorar kai tsaye, nau'in haraji na II/III/V/VI, albashi mai sauyawa, tallafi da ragewa na mutum. Ka tabbatar da ƙididdiga na yanzu tare da mai inshorarka ko ofishin biyan kuɗaɗe.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
